id=deverizonficator
name=DeVerizonficator
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=Hacktimepixel
description=Unlocks non-Verizon SIMs on Verizon Pixel 6a SKUs: strips the FCM simlock profile AND topic subscription from oobconfig prefs, kills the process holding the config in memory, then sets modem-side CarrierRestrictionRules to all-carriers-allowed via ITelephony (Rac.dex). Watcher re-applies on any re-restriction. Validated live: CARD_RESTRICTED -> LOADED.
